          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the SIHOO M18 ergonomic chair suitable for long work hours?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. The SIHOO M18 ergonomic office chair is designed for long sitting sessions with ergonomic lumbar support, breathable mesh materials, reclining functions, and adjustable seating features.</p>"
